{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le01ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I wonder what it's like to live in a distant galaxy. It must be so different than how we are living here.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Michelle</span>: Yeah totally. I think about it too. There's so much out there that hasn't been explored yet.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah. I mean look at all those stars. How far do you think they are?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Michelle</span>: Judging by their brightness, they could be millions of light years away.", "time": "3000", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le01ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow! That must be really far! Do you think there's life there?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Michelle</span>: Well, we aren't sure. There are theories out there that speculate that life could exist in some planets like Mars.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If I'll go to Mars, you'll come too, right? If there's anyone I'd go to Mars with, it would be you.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Michelle</span>: I'm flattered Vanessa. The problem is I have children and they  aren't the adventurous type.  If they won't go, it's hard for me to leave them.", "time": "28500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le01ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I totally understand, but I have an idea! If I'll draw a beautiful picture of Mars to them, there could be a chance for them to reconsider.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Michelle</span>: Haha. You're funny Vanessa! Let me tell you what. If you'll come up with a solid plan on how to get there and live, I'll convince my children to come along. What do you think?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  That would be great! There must be tons of research on how to do that in the library. I'll try to go first thing in the morning.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Michelle</span>: If you'll do that, I'll do my own research as well. This could be the start of something really special.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know! I'm so excited ...", "time": "58250", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about science and leisure time.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can express true, untrue and possible events in present. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express strong disapproval or refusal using <span class=\"italic\">if</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  Which planets in the solar system do you know about? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Which planet would you like to study about in more detail? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "I want to go to Mars!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_d